      "be2106159331_html": "Specification",
      "be650201872_html": "Accessories",
      "be57649318733_html": "<b>One-Person, 30-Second Open</b>",
      "be122563838_html": "Built for long days on the track and Gas strut assisted design allows the tent to open smoothly with minimal effort. The shell lifts evenly and stays stable throughout the motion, making setup quick and easy for one person. No forcing, no fiddling — just a controlled, reliable open every time.",
      "be550099690138_html": "<font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: -0.672px;\"><b>Fully Equipped, Ready for Real Touring</b></span></font>",
      "be1005829257_html": "The PeakRoof LT comes packed with practical features designed for serious Aussie travel. A rear-side power panel includes an Anderson input, Type-C and Type-A charging ports, a 12V socket, a master switch and a digital volt display, all positioned flush with the mattress for easy access. Two external shoe bags keep gear organised at camp, while a dedicated diesel heater vent port is built into the tent body for cold-weather trips. With everything integrated and ready to use, the LT delivers a complete, functional setup straight out of the box.",
      "be421242879254_html": "<font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: -0.672px;\"><b>\n</b></span></font><div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: -0.576px;\"><b>All-Around Ventilation — Stay Cool in Your Roof Tent</b></div></div>",
      "be418854419_html": "The PeakRoof LT is designed to stay comfortable in Australia’s shifting conditions. Large mesh windows on all sides create full cross-ventilation, keeping fresh air moving through the tent during warm nights. Inside, three integrated LED light strips offer both white and warm-yellow modes, giving you bright task lighting or a softer evening ambience with a quick switch. Whether you're camping in coastal heat or settling in after sunset, the LT stays cool, airy and easy to live in.",
      "be45129164480_html": "<b>Dual-layer comfort with a 50mm memory foam base and a 10mm cooling topper</b>",
      "be1464117415_html": "Built for long days on the track and chilly nights in the High Country, our dual-layer sleep system combines a supportive 50mm high-density memory foam base with a 10mm cooling comfort pad. The result is a mattress that relieves pressure, regulates heat and stays comfortable across changing Aussie conditions — from humid coastal nights to cool alpine mornings. Whether you’re on a quick weekend escape or a multi-day remote trip, this layered design ensures you wake up rested and ready for the next leg of the journey.",
      "be1579872987244_html": "<font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: -0.672px;\"><b>\n</b></span></font><div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: -0.576px;\"><b>Spacious Interior for Comfortable Sleeping</b></div></div>",
      "be1470844102_html": "The PeakRoof LT offers ample room for two to three people, with a 198cm × 124cm sleeping area that provides plenty of space for stretching out after a long day on the tracks. The interior height opens to 142cm, giving you enough headroom to sit up, change and move comfortably. Despite its generous space, the tent remains practical on the roof at",
      "be1943794596157_html": "<div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 19px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.672px;\"><b>Anderson Power Hub — Off-Grid Ready</b></span></div></div>",
      "be1226068625_html": "Keep your campsite fully powered with the PeakRoof LT’s internal command center, designed to connect directly to your setup via a heavy-duty Anderson plug. It includes a real-time voltage display to monitor your battery health, alongside multiple 12V and fast-charging USB ports. Whether you're running camp accessories or charging camera gear, you have reliable, safe power right at your fingertips.",
      "be1632117389263_html": "<font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: -0.672px;\"><b>\n</b></span></font><div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: -0.576px;\"><b style=\"letter-spacing: -0.576px;\">Aluminum Shell, Built Tough</b></div></div>",
      "be2037756573_html": "The base comes with a sturdy 2.3-metre telescopic ladder for easy access to your rooftop tent. is made from honeycomb aluminium panels, giving you a strong, insulated floor that stays stable on uneven ground. The tent body uses 300gsm breathable blackout poly-cotton, blocking light while still allowing airflow, while the 300D ripstop waterproof rainfly provides dependable protection when the weather turns. Tough, quiet and built to last — this shell is ready for years of off-road use.",
